### Describe the bug

An error will be reported when the super parameter contains an async function: 
`ReferenceError: this hasn't been initialised - super() hasn't been called`

### Input code

```typescript
class Foo extends Bar {
  constructor(options) {
    super(
      {
        callA: async () => {
          this.callA();
        },
      }
    );
  }
}
```


